@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #41546B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam classBorderColor #59708C
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF3F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #59708C
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
hide footbox
title API 权限查询 · structured

hide footbox
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12
skinparam BoxPadding 8
autonumber
participant "obj: IdentityController" as C
participant "service: StructuredIdentityService" as S
participant "tokenService: IdentityTokenService" as T
participant "identityDao: IdentityDao" as R
activate C
C -> S: checkApiPermission(authorization, operationId)
activate S
note over S,R: 展开 authenticatedUser / authenticated；省略 Bearer 解析与哈希工具调用
S -> T: claims = verify(token, COURSE_SYSTEM)
activate T
deactivate T
S -> R: active = activeSession(hash, now)
activate R
deactivate R
alt 会话已失效
 autonumber stop
 S --> C: ApiException (401 UNAUTHORIZED)
else 会话有效
 autonumber resume
 S -> R: user = userByExternalId(claims.subject())
 activate R
 deactivate R
 alt 用户不存在
  autonumber stop
  S --> C: ApiException (401 UNAUTHORIZED)
 else 用户存在
  note right of S: permission = API_PERMISSION_CODES.get(operationId)
  alt 操作未登记
   S --> C: ApiException (404 API_OPERATION_NOT_FOUND)
  else 操作已登记
   autonumber resume
   S -> R: permissions = permissions(user.id(), COURSE_SYSTEM)
   activate R
   deactivate R
   note right of S: allowed = permissions.contains(permission)
   autonumber stop
   S --> C: {operationId, allowed}
  end
 end
end
||12||
deactivate S
deactivate C
legend bottom
verify 的无效令牌异常由统一错误处理转换为 401，此处聚焦有效令牌后的分支。
ApiErrors 负责 HTTP 错误响应；Controller 正常返回 200 JSON。
endlegend
@enduml
